{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2020-10-30 16:15:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'COVINGTON, LA., OCT. 30, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- POOL CORPORATION (NASDAQ/GSM:POOL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 25, 2020, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 12, 2020.'}